		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="17166"></a><b>Zohran</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Dawnraider<br /><br /><br />Joined: 11 Apr 2003<br />Posts: 1007<br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17166&amp;sid=5c541fc64df937d4e95604b9217fa101#17166"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Jan 27, 2004 10:06 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: How to write an application.</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17166&amp;sid=5c541fc64df937d4e95604b9217fa101"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">When you apply to Dawnraiders there are certain things we would like to know about you. App's like "Hello, 65 druid, some AA's, ok gear, see you in game" is not enough.
<br />

<br />
Be sure to include:
<br />

<br />
- Name and class of your toon.
<br />
- level and number of AA's, in some cases list specific AA's (see the sticky called "Recruitment, read this before posting" for details on which AA's that are important for which class).
<br />
- Plane of Power flags.
<br />
- How much experience you have with raids, and what kind of content you have raided before.
<br />
- How long you have played EverQuest.
<br />
- Previous guild history (yes, even if it's on another server).
<br />
- A magelo profile (if you don't have one, make one - just visit <a href="http://www.magelo.com" target="_blank">www.magelo.com</a> and follow their instructions).
<br />
- How much playtime you have (number of evenings / week will do).
<br />
- What you are looking for in a guild, and in Dawnraiders specifically.
<br />
- Something about you as a person.
<br />

<br />
Also remember:
<br />

<br />
- If you choose to aply to several guilds at the same time it won't look good.
<br />
- We do have some requirements, they are listed in the sticky called "Recruitment, read this before posting". Here you will also find what classes we currently need. These needs/requirements will change with time, so be sure to check back now and then.
<br />
- If the "Recruitment, read this before posting" sticky says "We are not looking for bussdrivers" it means just that.
<br />

<br />
Good luck.
<br />

<br />
/Z</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
